#: src/app/gesicht_app.py
msgid "Infrared camera only for Winky"
msgstr ""

#: src/app/gesicht_app.py
msgid ""
"Normally every program in your account can switch on the cameras, including "
"harmful ones, and on many laptops the infrared camera can’t be covered. With "
"this switch, only Winky may use the infrared camera; other cameras stay as "
"they are. If another program needs the infrared camera (for example another "
"face unlock tool), turn this off. If the infrared camera shares its "
"connection with the normal camera, Winky leaves both as they are."
msgstr ""

#: src/app/gesicht_app.py
msgid "Strictness"
msgstr ""

#: src/app/gesicht_app.py
msgid ""
"How similar a face must be to yours (threshold). Higher is safer, but Winky "
"might recognize you less often. Default 0.65; your own face is usually well "
"above that. The check with a second person shows whether other faces stay "
"far enough below. Try it out once after every change."
msgstr ""

