msgid ""
"Only KeePassXC 2.8 or later, installed as a normal package. Older versions "
"don’t have quick unlock on Linux, and the Flatpak version can’t register it "
"with the system. There, KeePassXC keeps asking for the master password."
msgstr ""

#: src/app/gesicht_app.py
